# Files excluded from the publicly served asset bundle.
# Everything here would otherwise be downloadable straight from the site.
scripts
scripts/**
functions
functions/**
*.py
wrangler.toml
.assetsignore
AI_WORKFLOW.md
cloudflare_worker.js
cloudflare_crop_forecast.json
# The ICRISAT blob used to sit in public/data/ and was excluded here so it was
# not shipped to every visitor. It has since been deleted outright: the copy in
# git was a truncated download that would not parse, and a train-time input
# does not belong under public/ in the first place. The India yield snapshot
# now lives at scripts/yield_model/india/data/, which the browser never reads,
# so no exclusion is needed.
